# The console's font and character set (console-setup, at every start): Terminus with the set
# console-setup calls "Vietnamese": of its 512-glyph Terminus fonts it is the one that has "ū"
# (sūveryn), the French and Dutch letters, the box characters and the half blocks (▀ ▄) the
# registration QR code is drawn with (#37). Uni2 lacks the half blocks.
ACTIVE_CONSOLES="/dev/tty[1-6]"
CHARMAP="UTF-8"
CODESET="Vietnamese"
FONTFACE="Terminus"
FONTSIZE="8x16"
VIDEOMODE=
